{'symbol': 'MRNA', 'date': '2022-03-10 08:23:00', 'title': 'MODERNA ANNOUNCES FIRST PARTICIPANT DOSED IN PHASE 2 STUDY OF OMICRON-SPECIFIC BIVALENT BOOSTER CANDIDATE', 'text': 'MODERNA\'S OMICRON-SPECIFIC BIVALENT BOOSTER CANDIDATE (MRNA-1273.214) COMBINES MODERNA\'S OMICRON-SPECIFIC BOOSTER CANDIDATE (MRNA-1273.529) AND THE MODERNA COVID-19 VACCINE (MRNA-1273) MODERNA EXPECTS TO ENROLL APPROXIMATELY 375 PARTICIPANTS IN THE U.S. CAMBRIDGE, MA / ACCESSWIRE / MARCH 10, 2022 / MODERNA, INC. (NASDAQ:MRNA), A BIOTECHNOLOGY COMPANY PIONEERING MESSENGER RNA (MRNA) THERAPEUTICS AND VACCINES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE FIRST PARTICIPANT HAS BEEN DOSED IN THE PHASE 2 STUDY OF THE COMPANY\'S OMICRON-SPECIFIC BIVALENT BOOSTER CANDIDATE (MRNA-1273.214), WHICH COMBINES MODERNA\'S OMICRON-SPECIFIC BOOSTER CANDIDATE (MRNA-1273.529) AND THE MODERNA COVID-19 VACCINE (MRNA-1273). "WE ARE PLEASED TO BEGIN THIS STUDY OF OUR BIVALENT BOOSTER CANDIDATE THAT INCLUDES OUR OMICRON-SPECIFIC CANDIDATE AND THE MODERNA COVID-19 VACCINE.'}